reated_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/01de1c88/uploads/origins/15f9943e-c663-4317-9353-fd7c0e91b454?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c410ab78c16a5f9f9554faab4445a710", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/01de1c88/uploads/origins/15f9943e-c663-4317-9353-fd7c0e91b454?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c410ab78c16a5f9f9554faab4445a710, https://si.imgix.net/01de1c88/uploads/origins/15f9943e-c663-4317-9353-fd7c0e91b454?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a54704ed281a9b24b5ea77c2817b72de 2x, https://si.imgix.net/01de1c88/uploads/origins/15f9943e-c663-4317-9353-fd7c0e91b454?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0aed89a384dd24f5776ccd2e5a331021 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I saw your dragons and was impressed, so I would like to request a dragon as well. I would like you to draw my OC, a red demonic dragon, standing proudly and roaring. He has the mixed features of a dragon and a demonic humanoid form, his head has large teeth and large black horns. The other important feature is five scars across his chest. Pictures for reference: https://imgur.com/a/yUEGZBZ\n\nThank you very much.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/yUEGZBZ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cac4b77/uploads/origins/cc419756-e5eb-476c-9916-fe5b12339b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=233a5ae62faf41e294f707f181ccacc9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cac4b77/uploads/origins/cc419756-e5eb-476c-9916-fe5b12339b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=233a5ae62faf41e294f707f181ccacc9, https://si.imgix.net/3cac4b77/uploads/origins/cc419756-e5eb-476c-9916-fe5b12339b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acda8f49669920521944530b8911ae56 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cac4b77/uploads/origins/cc419756-e5eb-476c-9916-fe5b12339b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c5a762a6c7a6b6f16d65217e7d339e5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして、冬狼/Anfauglirと申します。\n\n今回依頼したい内容は：\n- うちの仔のイラストを描いてほしいです。\n彼は吹雪と烈風を自由自在に操れる、クリスタルから封じられた思いを読み取れる、\n探究心が強い、寒い所が大好きなドラゴンです。\n- 内容と構図などはおまかせです。\n\nよろしくおねがいします！\n\nhttps://www2.cs.ccu.edu.tw/~lws98m/AFX_drg-v21.08-F_ja_220328.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8e8b6c4c/uploads/origins/e7389ad3-d0a5-4320-a3d6-99b4a088edd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79b979bc4ba1afbfade4ea1fea70bdf9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8e8b6c4c/uploads/origins/e7389ad3-d0a5-4320-a3d6-99b4a088edd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79b979bc4ba1afbfade4ea1fea70bdf9, https://si.imgix.net/8e8b6c4c/uploads/origins/e7389ad3-d0a5-4320-a3d6-99b4a088edd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d9e5593d4de436f93c634e4ca3810c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8e8b6c4c/uploads/origins/e7389ad3-d0a5-4320-a3d6-99b4a088edd4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21c515a0b62fdbb9d64eccfcc144c72f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは私はあなたのドラゴンの描き方が大好きで、私のドラゴンのキャラクターをあなたのスタイルで描いていただけませんか？彼女の名前はメリーで、イルカやサメのようなエラと皮膚を持つ水生ドラゴンです。彼女の参考文献はこちらです : https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/948763216270487613/951555297565097984/mellisfwreference.png\n\n海の中の彼女を描いてほしいです。ポーズはおまかせしますが、水中が希望です。海が大好きで、果物のような香水のような息をする、優しくて遊び好きなドラゴンです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1b0a7610/uploads/origins/28a81bf5-ee28-47d4-ae50-099a3225bb6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bdbfb65f1dc235c4cd3f662e61565bf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1b0a7610/uploads/origins/28a81bf5-ee28-47d4-ae50-099a3225bb6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bdbfb65f1dc235c4cd3f662e61565bf, https://si.imgix.net/1b0a7610/uploads/origins/28a81bf5-ee28-47d4-ae50-099a3225bb6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98e34cbdcbdff70148a57275045ebda6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1b0a7610/uploads/origins/28a81bf5-ee28-47d4-ae50-099a3225bb6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29eea3cd63ce6cd13ee5d72589ec76ae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I really like your work and I would like to inquire if you could do my dragon character in your style? I enjoy the style of your dragons greatly and would like to see if you could do mine as more of a quadrupedal, standard fashion.  \nhttps://toyhou.se/12737507.rigel/gallery\n \nThe drawing can be basic in posture as long as it shows off the character well enough in the fierce and enjoyable style of yours.\nLike these two examples.\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/760865483271569408/925550948737249290/unknown.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/760865483271569408/925249876038672404/IMG_20211227_234858.png\n \nA few notes for any style decisions you may go for is that he's an ice dragon that prefers cold environments and prefers night over day.\nThe fluff/fur in some of the pictures aren't mandatory and mostly an accessory, he's primarily scaled and would like an emphasis on that. \n \nI leave the rest of the decisions to your draconic expertise.  \n \nThank you in advance if you take this request!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a56c14d/uploads/origins/6c78cb44-f62a-4ad5-9d76-209c20469c90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9958a329bc5273928ef689f37b4b3305", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0a56c14d/uploads/origins/6c78cb44-f62a-4ad5-9d76-209c20469c90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9958a329bc5273928ef689f37b4b3305, https://si.imgix.net/0a56c14d/uploads/origins/6c78cb44-f62a-4ad5-9d76-209c20469c90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09a2993172b2378f04b8d5e63d6b8405 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0a56c14d/uploads/origins/6c78cb44-f62a-4ad5-9d76-209c20469c90?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63c01f6032e828d1ecc5f299b43e6890 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。\nオリキャラ幼竜のティレイラのイラストを宜しければお願いします。\n\n好奇心旺盛で美味しい食べ物があれば上機嫌になるティレイラが\nゆったりくつろいでいる雰囲気のお任せのスタイルで描いて頂きたいです。\n\nオリキャラ（ティレイラ）参考画像\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1YLn0d3EYO6Lg4vcV8cnMCgVnbZ8v2wLB/view", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c50a030e/uploads/origins/3c351f3d-8b78-48a8-b6a0-9017d7487762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9b5c3118e29a85cb0f49da57af9be03", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c50a030e/uploads/origins/3c351f3d-8b78-48a8-b6a0-9017d7487762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9b5c3118e29a85cb0f49da57af9be03, https://si.imgix.net/c50a030e/uploads/origins/3c351f3d-8b78-48a8-b6a0-9017d7487762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=abb28eca42a98c1c533d6a49f56c82a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c50a030e/uploads/origins/3c351f3d-8b78-48a8-b6a0-9017d7487762?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=700f22353f20e3fe2d9267d954ba33a6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n\n私のキャラクターを元にしたドラゴンを描いていただくことは可能でしょうか？\n星と宝が好きな赤いドラゴンです。\n\nこのような光り輝く翼の模様を描いていただけないでしょうか？\nhttps://monsterhunterworld.wiki.fextralife.com/file/Monster-Hunter-World/mhwi-safi'jiiva_screenshot_004.jpg\n\nその他のデザインは、お好みでどうぞ。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://sta.sh/0ew96v5b3fw", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf0178a0/requests/276248_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87f0555e4f4afc5f9fde100b79cbd78c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf0178a0/requests/276248_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87f0555e4f4afc5f9fde100b79cbd78c, https://si.imgix.net/bf0178a0/requests/276248_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32d0991cd0f0172071b7ae54d2724b77 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf0178a0/requests/276248_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d46c0ed4e398f630099247c5720a4b62 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi there!\n\nCan you draw an OC for my friend? Its a gift for her over the holidays. Pose your choice. \n\nCharacter\nhttps://imgur.com/a/uWbDe53", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nigihayami461/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b536a42f/requests/260384_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5398a26041d9918f674fbb914da6e69", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b536a42f/requests/260384_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5398a26041d9918f674fbb914da6e69, https://si.imgix.net/b536a42f/requests/260384_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ed4483456189a1f666b30725d270b88 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b536a42f/requests/260384_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ae779eed02153bbffb4cdf68147d3e6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは!あなたの作品は本当に良いですね!私のOCのために一枚だけイラストをお願いしたいと思います。\n彼の名前はStarry、星にまつわる不思議なドラゴンです。\n他にも何でも構いません。気に入ったものがあれば変更しても構いません。彼に一番似合うと思うイラストを作ってください、よろしくお願いします\n\nURLにはいくつかの参照が含まれていますが、何かが矛盾しているか、またはあなたがどれに基づいているかわからない場合は、149782、149782-1および188421をベースにしてください。彼の前の爪は4本指で、彼の後ろの爪は3本指です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RdLQbcxJMCPmdiiBkVAzXnQAWw_-iphy?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}